OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks to cut              
OL,4,A'non-essential' translations           
OL,6,FCouncillor Ciera Hudspith said the     
OL,7,Fparty would discuss the policy in      
OL,8,FJanuary, then launch a review to       
OL,9,Fdiscover what language services it     
OL,10,Fprovides and whether any of it could be
OL,11,Flegally reduced.                       
